  "description": "This circular loop walk explores Belleek Woods in Ballina County Tipperary. On the eastern side of the woods there's the Belleek Woods Greenway. The shared cycling and walking trail runs along the River Moy Estuary. The forest also includes Belleek Manor, a 19th-century manor house which now operates as a hotel. There are some lovely grounds to explore at this historic local site.You can continue your walking in the area on theEnniscrone Coastal Walk.",
